e was there celebrating his role in the  great gatsby but seemed more interested  in gaining kara's affections  according to insiders though kara wasn't  interested maybe it's time leo focuses  on finding a model his own age  i'm not gonna answer that question i  like to keep my private life private  one woman's loss is another woman's gain  so it seemed at least when taylor swift  apparently made a move on bradley cooper  after his split with zoe saldana in  2013.  it all happened at the golden globes  where taylor asked her friend jennifer  lawrence to make the introduction  since she and bradley co-starred in the  silver linings playbook  but bradley rejected taylor preferring  someone his own age and looking for  something a little more serious  if only leonardo dicaprio could take a  page out of bradley cooper's book  josh hutcherson had a major crush on  emma watson  who doesn't honestly well other than tom  felton  hutcherson even went so far as to ask  his manager to get in touch with her  manager in order to set up a meeting  between the two actors  sadly for him nothing came of it i had  like the most embarrassing moment  i think of my entire life maybe he  should have tried the direct route  it hasn't happened yet one day fingers  crossed he said  poor josh it's been seven years since he  revealed his crush so safe to say that  one day  probably won't come anytime soon when  hilary duff and aaron carter were  fresh-faced and just starting out  they actually dated for a time it makes  sense both were teen idols and  aaron even made an appearance on lizzie  mcguire more than a decade later though  aaron seems to have trouble letting go  of the past  he publicly declared his love for  hillary duff on multiple occasions  even tweeting about how he'll spend the  rest of his life trying to get back to  her  asked about it on watch what happens  live with andy cohen hillary was pretty  uncomfortable it was so many years ago  right i literally haven't seen him and  so it's uncomfortable  and speaking of aaron carter's exes  lindsay lohan also makes the cut of  actors who've rejected other stars  now if harry styles showed up at your  door in the middle of the night would  you turn him away  who in their right mind would well  lindsay lohan apparently  do i know you the superstar singer  supposedly showed up at lindsay's hotel  room one night at two in the morning  surprisingly lindsay says she didn't  recognize him and had no idea who he was  or why he was there  so she simply said good night and sent  him away  the vamp singer james mcvay and game of  thrones actress sophie turner briefly  dated in 2014  but then things got a little messy on  twitter sophie ultimately tweeted  asking him to please stop texting me  it's getting creepy and i'm sorry  i'm not interested thank god the  internet is there to document the messy  breakup forever  i'm gonna go years later mcveigh claimed  the whole thing was a joke between the  two and wished sophie happiness with now  husband joe jonas but it seems a little  bit like he was trying to backtrack  now that sophie has moved on for the  better nicole kidman appeared on the  tonight show in 2015 and spilled to  jimmy fallon that she'd had an  unrequited crush on him when they first  met years earlier  she thought they were meeting for a date  but jimmy thought it was a meet-up to  discuss working together so he totally  failed to impress her  and then you put a video game on or  something and  she took it as him having no interest  talk about a missed connection  fallon was floored when nicole revealed  she'd been interested in him  all those years ago what  are you talking about poor jimmy didn't  even realize he'd blown his chance to  date nicole kidman  but both are happily married so it  seemed to work out for the best  next up taylor swift and brenton  thwaites both starred in the giver in  2014  which of course sent up rumors left and  right that the two were dating  especially after they both appeared in a  photo together at the toronto  international film festival  the waits cleared things up though  saying it was surreal that people  thought they were together  we know taylor is a bit of a serial  dater so it makes sense she would go  after a hunky co-star  but still having someone publicly  announce their disinterest has gotta  hurt  brenton and i just go to jeff's room and  play guitar with him and speaking of  public humiliation  aziz anzari told the story of how blake  lively rejected him on howard stern's  talk show  according to aziz the two supposedly  traded phone numbers at an event way  back in 2011  after he learned that blake was a fan of  his work aziz texted her afterward but  never even got a response  being ghosted by the person you're into  is another level of painful  who knows if that was even her real  phone number but blake is now happily  married to ryan reynolds so it's safe to  say  she's not feeling any regrets first  texts 4 11 am  i love alcohol the young stars of  netflix to all the boys i've loved  before  reportedly had a mighty powerful spark  off-screen as well as on  according to lana condor who plays lead  character lara jean  the two actors were hanging out at  noah's apartment having pizza  and she felt something for him  unfortunately though she told him  noah it's not going to happen between us  it's one thing to be rejected by someone  else but stepping in and drawing a line  in spite of your desires is kind of  commendable  they agreed to be mature and keep things  professional but the spark is  definitely still there in an interview  with buzzfeed tiffany haddish was asked  what she would do  if she met her celebrity crush her  answer she already had  and being as bold as she is she straight  up asked her crushes out on a date they  all turned me down  you ever know him i could be george  that's rough but we can't help but  admire tiffany's openness and tenacity  better to rip the bandage off and h